  (50, 'disable', 'Disable', 1, 'status', null, 100, 20, 0, 'Disables the target’s last used move, preventing its use for 4–7 turns, selected at random, or until the target leaves the field. If the target hasn’t used a move since entering the field, if it tried to use a move this turn and failed, if its last used move has 0 PP remaining, or if it already has a move disabled, this move will fail.', 2500, 'ranged', 'unit', 'single', 4, 0, 0, 0),
